OL,3,GNEWSAPoldark cave cordoned off after
OL,4,Acliff fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA popular beach cave which featured in
OL,7,Fthe TV series Poldark has collapsed
OL,8,Ffollowing a cliff fall in Cornwall.
OL,10,FThe collapse at the historical landmark
OL,11,FHolywell cave in Holywell Bay, Newquay,
OL,12,FCornwall, is thought to have happened
OL,13,Fovernight on Saturday.
OL,15,FThe cave, also known as St Cuthbert's
OL,16,FCave, had been tucked under the
OL,17,Fsouthern cliffs of Kelsey Head.
OL,19,FCoastguards and the RNLI confirmed the
OL,20,Fincident. The cave was cordoned off by
OL,21,Flifeguards, according to witnesses.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
